MAMC2 portable SSD backend

The Mamba2 architecture, parameter layout, and SSD equations are described by:
Tri Dao and Albert Gu, Transformers are SSMs: Generalized Models and Efficient
Algorithms Through Structured State Space Duality (2024).
https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.21060

Upstream implementation reference (Apache License 2.0):
https://github.com/state-spaces/mamba
Copyright (c) 2024, Tri Dao, Albert Gu.

mamc/mamba2.py is a locally written restricted implementation of those equations;
it does not vendor the upstream Triton or CUDA source files. The optional official
backend imports mamba-ssm, which remains subject to its own license.

mamc/csp.py adapts the complex subband / phase motion logic supplied in CSPMNet.py
in this repository. The original reference file is retained unchanged.

The repository's original LICENSE is retained.
